  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. Alibaba MNN P/Invoke layer with Qwen 3 chat generator. 1.3.1 fixes \"Unable to load DLL 'mnnbridge'\" on clean Windows hosts: (a) runtimes/win-x64/native/{mnnbridge.dll,MNN.dll} now CopyToOutputDirectory so consumers via ProjectReference also get them (NuGet consumers always did); (b) new NativeRuntimePrep flattens the fetched MNN core (lib/x64/Release/Dynamic/MD/MNN.dll) into AppContext.BaseDirectory/runtimes/{rid}/native/ next to mnnbridge.dll so Windows transitive-dep loading finds it, then preloads it absolutely as defence-in-depth, then runs a self-check that throws an actionable error naming every expected path when load fails (instead of the cryptic 0x8007007E). 1.3.0 added multi-file MNN bundle support (EnsureBundleAsync, BundleFileSpec). 1.2.3 fixed the SHA-256 \"sha256:\" prefix-strip bug + set a realistic User-Agent.",
